{"id":"40b5741849fa2fc1","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-logically-valid.md","title":"Logically Valid","display":"df-logically-valid — Logically Valid","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-logically-valid","aliases":["92-df-logically-valid"],"display":"df-logically-valid — Logically Valid","depends_on":["[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-valid]]"],"source":"本地算术结构的 Tarski 语义；对照原书第 II 章 pp.18–19 的指定解释；任意结构版本是本地展开","source_status":"原书解释概念的本地语义扩展"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-logically-valid"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-logically-valid</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-logically-valid — Logically Valid"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a8528bdacedf47a3\" href=\"?note=a8528bdacedf47a3\" title=\"92-df-valid\">92-df-valid</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地算术结构的 Tarski 语义；对照原书第 II 章 pp.18–19 的指定解释；任意结构版本是本地展开"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书解释概念的本地语义扩展"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Valid}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Valid}_G\\)</span> (validity predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a8528bdacedf47a3\" href=\"?note=a8528bdacedf47a3\" title=\"92-df-valid\">92-df-valid</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logically\\text{-}valid} \\vdash \\models_G\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Valid}_G(\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logically\\text{-}valid} \\vdash \\models_G\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Valid}_G(\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models \\varphi\">\\(\\models \\varphi\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>是逻辑有效的（在所有结构中真）</li>\n<li>逻辑有效句子是&quot;必然真&quot;的</li>\n<li>例：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\;(x = x)\">\\(\\forall x\\;(x = x)\\)</span>是逻辑有效</li>\n<li>区别：在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span>中真 ≠ 逻辑有效</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>含非逻辑算术公理，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(G\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span>一般只推出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\models_G\\varphi\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\models_G\\varphi\\)</span>，不推出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_G\\varphi\">\\(\\models_G\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li>对标准纯一阶逻辑演算，可靠性与完备性给出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{FOL}}\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\models_G\\varphi\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathrm{FOL}}\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\models_G\\varphi\\)</span>；Gödel不完备性讨论的是带算术公理的理论，不能用来否定这一反向蕴涵</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-valid","status":"resolved","id":"a8528bdacedf47a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-valid]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-valid","status":"resolved","id":"a8528bdacedf47a3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Valid}_G$ (validity predicate, see [[92-df-valid]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Valid}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logically\\text{-}valid} \\vdash \\models_G\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Valid}_G(\\varphi)","display":true},{"tex":"\\models \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\;(x = x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\models_G\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_G\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{FOL}}\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\models_G\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1326,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-logically-valid]]"}],"outgoing":["90f32e29c9d553ed","a8528bdacedf47a3"]}